      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Audiolink contains some non audio-related metadata eg:SyncNetTime. For the purposes of this Accessibility feature targeting Reactive Effects Ideally metadata pixels are left intact.\n\nCurrently photosensitive PC users can locally disable the audio reactive elements of Audiolink via a shader on their avatar. However Mobile users can't as custom avatar shaders are not supported for non-PC platforms. This feature request targets accessibility feature parity for all platforms.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
